              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Goals</h3>
            <p>
              My goal is to work on projects that make a real difference,
